<h2 id="what-youll-learn">What You’ll Learn</h2>

<ul>
  <li>The difference between multi-cloud and polycloud approaches</li>
  <li>When polycloud makes sense — and when it adds unnecessary complexity</li>
  <li>Architectural patterns for managing workloads across AWS, Azure, and GCP</li>
  <li>Data management, networking, and identity challenges in a polycloud environment</li>
  <li>Organizational and tooling considerations for polycloud operations</li>
</ul>
